{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-24-1","title":"Psalms 24:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God's lordship in the world. 3 The citizens of his spiritual kingdom. 7 An exhortation to receive him.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2962. B.C. 1042. earth. 50:12; Ex 9:29; 19:5; De 10:14; 1Ch 29:11; Job 41:11; Da 4:25 1Co 10:26 world. 89:11; 98:7; Na 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-2","title":"Psalms 24:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>For. 33:6; 95:4; 104:5,6; 136:6; Ge 1:9,10; Job 38:4; Jer 10:11-16 2Pe 3:5-7 and. 93:1; 96:10; Ge 8:22; Job 38:8-11; Jer 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-3","title":"Psalms 24:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Who. 15:1; 68:18; Joh 13:36; 20:17; Eph 4:8-10 the hill. 68:15,16; 78:68,69; 132:13,14; 2Sa 6:12-17; 1Ch 15:1,25-28 Heb 12:22-24 stand. Le 10:3; Mal 3:1; Heb 12:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-4","title":"Psalms 24:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>He that, etc. Heb. the clean of hands. 18:20; 26:6; Job 9:30; 17:9; Isa 1:15,16; 33:15,16; 1Ti 2:8; Jas 4:8 pure. 51:10; 73:1; Ge 6:5; Pr 20:9; Jer 4:14; Mt 5:8; Ac 15:9; 2Co 7:1 Re 21:1-4,27; 22:14,15 lifted. 25:1; 143:8; De 4:19; Eze 18:6,15; Ac 14:15 sworn. 15:4; Jer 5:2; 7:9,10; Zec 5:3,4; Mal 3:5; 1Ti 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-5","title":"Psalms 24:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>receive. 50:23; 67:6,7; 72:17; 115:12,13; 128:1-5; Nu 6:24-27; Isa 33:15-17 Mt 5:3-12; Joh 7:17; Ro 4:6-9; Ga 3:9,14; Eph 1:3; 1Pe 3:9 righteousness. Isa 46:13; 51:5,6,8; 54:17; 61:10; Ro 3:22; 5:17,18; 1Co 1:30 2Co 5:21; Ga 5:5; Php 3:9 God. 68:19; 88:1; Isa 12:2; 45:17; Tit 2:10-14; 3:4-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-6","title":"Psalms 24:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>This is. 22:30; 73:15; Isa 53:10; Ro 4:16; 1Pe 2:9 that seek. 27:8; 105:4; Joh 1:47 O Jacob. or, O God of Jacob.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-7","title":"Psalms 24:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Lift. 118:19,20; Isa 26:2 King. 21:1,5; 97:6; Hag 2:7,9; Mal 3:1; 1Co 2:8; Jas 2:1; 2Pe 3:18 Re 4:11 shall. 68:16-18; 132:8; Nu 10:35,36; 2Sa 6:17; 1Ki 8:6,11; Mr 16:19 Eph 4:8-10; 1Pe 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-8","title":"Psalms 24:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>The Lord strong. 45:3-6; 50:1; 93:1; Isa 9:6; 19:24-25; 63:1-6; Col 2:15; Re 6:2 Re 19:11-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-24-10","title":"Psalms 24:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>The Lord. Isa 6:3-5; 54:5; Ho 12:3-5; Zec 2:8-11; Joh 12:40; 14:9 he is. 2:6-12; Mt 25:31,34; Lu 9:26; Tit 2:13</p>"}]}